		"viz_info_overview": {
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "#131a23",
				"fontColor": "#ecf0f5",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Metric Reference — Overview Tab\n\n---\n\n#### Firewall\n\n**Blocked (24h)** — Firewall denied connections from ASA + FTD\n**Allowed (24h)** — Firewall permitted connections\n**Top Blocked Destinations** — Most frequently denied external IPs\n**Firewall Trend** — Blocked vs allowed traffic over time\n\n---\n\n#### Identity & Access\n\n**ISE Auth** — ISE authentication success rate (%)\n**Failed (ISE+AD)** — Combined failed logon events from ISE and Active Directory\n**Lockouts (AD)** — Account lockout events (Event ID 4740)\n**Privileged (AD)** — Privileged logon events (Event ID 4672)\n\n---\n\n#### Email & Threat Intelligence\n\n**Email Blocked** — Blocked email messages from ESA/CES\n**Email Delivered** — Successfully delivered messages\n**Top Blocked Senders** — Most frequently blocked email senders\n**XDR Incidents** — Active incidents from SecureX/XDR"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_info_panel": {
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "#131a23",
				"fontColor": "#ecf0f5",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Metric Reference — Details & KPI Reference Tab\n\n---\n\n#### Privileged Access\n\n**Top Privileged Users (AD 4672)** — Most-active admin accounts by event count\n**Privileged Logon Trend (14d)** — 14-day trend of privileged logon events\n\n---\n\n#### Failed Authentication\n\n**Top Failed Logon Users** — User accounts with the most failed authentication attempts\n**Top Failed Logon Sources** — Source hosts/IPs generating the most failed logon attempts\n\n---\n\n#### Account Lockouts\n\n**Top Locked Accounts (AD 4740)** — Accounts most frequently locked out\n**Identity Events Trend (AD + ISE, 14d)** — 14-day combined identity event trend\n\n---\n\n#### ISE Deep-Dive\n\n**ISE Auth by NAS** — Authentication events broken down by network access server\n**ISE Failure Reasons** — Top ISE authentication failure reasons"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
